      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Activate before launching the agent: "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "bun run claude",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "code"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " / "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "bun run opencode",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "code"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " (cross-platform) or "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "direnv",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "code"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " + "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ".envrc",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "code"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " (Mac/Linux). If a var doesn't load, the MCP returns 401/403 — fix "
